                            {
                                "example_id": "125290cd-2715-427d-b753-d2c0a6514b84",
                                "sense_id": "d7a94538-9b53-3c23-b38d-8d50e8365dea",
                                "text": "Да́льше, на боло́тце, за́просто цвела́ ночна́я фиа́лка, за ним пришло́сь пересе́чь прое́зжую доро́гу, — и спра́ва забеле́лась кали́тка: вход в парк.",
                                "translation": "Farther on, a bog orchis bloomed unceremoniously in a patch of marshy ground, behind which he had to cross a back road, and off to the right a white wicket gate gleamed: the entrance to the park.",
                                "english": "Farther on, a bog orchis bloomed unceremoniously in a patch of marshy ground, behind which he had to cross a back road, and off to the right a white wicket gate gleamed: the entrance to the park."
